{"id":1318,"title":"Python 数字及字符串 ","summary":"Python 数字及字符串 ","tags":"","components":[{"type":"QuizRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7a5b97eb-0888-3637-a38b-00a04d7b554a","title":"Python 数据类型 ","question_id":2915,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"question_id":2915,"title":"Python 数据类型 ","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"232ad45a-0313-33a3-ad9e-1f556eab607e","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在 Python 中有 6 大数据类型：\n1. number（数字）\n2. string（字符串）\n3. list（列表）\n4. tuple（元组）\n5. set（集合）\n6. dictionary（字典）。\n\n接下来我们先回顾下Python数字及字符串类型的基本知识。","text_html":"<p>在 Python 中有 6 大数据类型：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>number（数字）</li>\n<li>string（字符串）</li>\n<li>list（列表）</li>\n<li>tuple（元组）</li>\n<li>set（集合）</li>\n<li>dictionary（字典）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>接下来我们先回顾下Python数字及字符串类型的基本知识。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"下面那一个数据类型不是Python内置6大数据类型:","question_text_html":"<p>下面那一个数据类型不是Python内置6大数据类型:</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":10282,"key":"A","text":"图","text_html":"<p>数字</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10283,"key":"B","text":"字符串","text_html":"<p>字符串</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10284,"key":"C","text":"数字","text_html":"<p>图</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10285,"key":"D","text":"列表","text_html":"<p>列表</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"QuizRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"43242d8f-5097-3ae8-87de-226cc081251b","title":"数字类型","question_id":2916,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"question_id":2916,"title":"数字类型","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"28d0a252-70a8-3e2d-9d2e-75a7ae760303","title":"","title_html":"","text":"### 数字类型\nPython3 支持 4 种类型的数字：\n1. int（整数类型）\n2. float（浮点类型）\n3. bool（布尔类型）\n4. complex（复数类型）\n\n在 Python3 中可以使用 type()函数来查看数字类型，如下所示:","text_html":"<h3>数字类型</h3>\n<p>Python3 支持 4 种类型的数字：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>int（整数类型）</li>\n<li>float（浮点类型）</li>\n<li>bool（布尔类型）</li>\n<li>complex（复数类型）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>在 Python3 中可以使用 type()函数来查看数字类型，如下所示:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"06fac7ed-060f-3251-b261-2b1f66548c5f","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"a=1\nb=3.14\nc=True\nprint(type(a),type(b),type(c))\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a66b0bbe-4c1c-3a80-a97d-246f9794dd33","title":"","title_html":"","text":"输出为:\n\n```text\n<class 'int'> <class 'float'> <class 'bool'>\n```\n\n### 运算类型\n\nPython 3 所支持的运算类型包括:\n1. 加法 `+`\n2. 减法 `-`\n3. 除法 `/`\n4. 整除 `//`\n5. 取余 `%`\n6. 乘法 `*`\n7. 乘方 `**`\n\n示例代码:","text_html":"<p>输出为:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;class &#x27;int&#x27;&gt; &lt;class &#x27;float&#x27;&gt; &lt;class &#x27;bool&#x27;&gt;\n</code></pre>\n<h3>运算类型</h3>\n<p>Python 3 所支持的运算类型包括:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>加法 <code>+</code></li>\n<li>减法 <code>-</code></li>\n<li>除法 <code>/</code></li>\n<li>整除 <code>//</code></li>\n<li>取余 <code>%</code></li>\n<li>乘法 <code>*</code></li>\n<li>乘方 <code>**</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p>示例代码:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"37734aff-ebb5-3de9-8006-5fc3c71597d7","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"print(15+2)  # 加法运算\nprint(15-2)  # 减法运算 \nprint(15/2)  # 除法运算 \nprint(15//2) # 整除运算 \nprint(15%2)  # 取余运算 \nprint(15*2)  # 乘法运算 \nprint(15**2) # 乘方运算 \n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9362f635-eb08-385c-a673-2d3fefadf2c7","title":"","title_html":"","text":"结果为:\n\n```text\n17\n13\n7.5\n7\n1\n30\n225\n```","text_html":"<p>结果为:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">17\n13\n7.5\n7\n1\n30\n225\n</code></pre>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4}],"question_type":"multi_type_in","question_text":"填空，输出2的10次方:\n\n```typein\nprint(2__0__10)\n```","question_text_html":"<p>填空，输出2的10次方:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python_typein\">print(2{0}10)\n</code></pre>\n","question_options":[{"id":10286,"key":"A","text":"**","text_html":"<p>**</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":1,"max_length":5,"properties":{"prefix":"","postfix":""}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"QuizRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ccfd6c6e-98e2-3c0c-a8e4-848c3ded0492","title":"字符串类型","question_id":2917,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"question_id":2917,"title":"字符串类型","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"098b47a2-2d4a-307f-8050-88b3164bac5a","title":"","title_html":"","text":"### 字符串类型 \n\n字符串就是在单引号`'`、双引号`\"`和三引号`\"\"\"` 或 `'''`之间的文字。单引号字符串示例：`print('welcome to hangzhou')`，其中所有的空格和制表符都照原样保留。单引号与双引号的作用其实是一样的，但是当引号里包含单引号时，则该引号需使用双引号，例如 `print(\"what's your name?\")`。三引号可以指示**一个多行**的字符串，也可以在三引号中自由使用单引号和双引号，如下所示:","text_html":"<h3>字符串类型</h3>\n<p>字符串就是在单引号<code>&#x27;</code>、双引号<code>&quot;</code>和三引号<code>&quot;&quot;&quot;</code> 或 <code>&#x27;&#x27;&#x27;</code>之间的文字。单引号字符串示例：<code>print(&#x27;welcome to hangzhou&#x27;)</code>，其中所有的空格和制表符都照原样保留。单引号与双引号的作用其实是一样的，但是当引号里包含单引号时，则该引号需使用双引号，例如 <code>print(&quot;what&#x27;s your name?&quot;)</code>。三引号可以指示<strong>一个多行</strong>的字符串，也可以在三引号中自由使用单引号和双引号，如下所示:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"65d2e11d-120c-3329-8184-cde6883f02d0","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"print('''how are you?\nI'm fine! and you?\nI'm file.\nmy name is \"python\"\n''')\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3f087584-e129-37a2-bd1c-5a428013d1a4","title":"","title_html":"","text":"### 字符串的表示\n\n如果要在单引号`'`字符串中使用单引号本身`'`，在双引号`\"`字符串中使用双引号`\"`本身，则需要借助转义符`\\`，如下所示:","text_html":"<h3>字符串的表示</h3>\n<p>如果要在单引号<code>&#x27;</code>字符串中使用单引号本身<code>&#x27;</code>，在双引号<code>&quot;</code>字符串中使用双引号<code>&quot;</code>本身，则需要借助转义符<code>\\</code>，如下所示:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c26c89b3-ae11-3e78-ba3e-e4b47b9567cf","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"print('i\\'m file')\nprint(\"i'm file, my name is \\\"python\\\"\")\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"aae05a0f-aecc-3a81-878f-91a4397c29f7","title":"","title_html":"","text":"输出为:\n\n```text\ni'm file\ni'm file, my name is \"python\"\n```","text_html":"<p>输出为:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"820ff898-6b10-3f9c-b862-fb243254da52","title":"","title_html":"","text":"> 注意：在一个字符串中，行末单独的反斜杠`\\`表示下一行继续，而不是开始写新的一行。另外，可以使用双反斜杠`\\\\`来表示反斜杠`\\`本身，而`\\n` 表示换行符。\n\n如果想要指示某些不需要使用转义符进行特别处理的字符串，那么需要指定一个原始字符串。原始字符串通过给字符串加上前缀 `r` 或 `R` 的方式指定，比如需要原样输出`\\n` 而不是令其换行，则代码如下:","text_html":"<blockquote>\n<p>注意：在一个字符串中，行末单独的反斜杠<code>\\</code>表示下一行继续，而不是开始写新的一行。另外，可以使用双反斜杠<code>\\\\</code>来表示反斜杠<code>\\</code>本身，而<code>\\n</code> 表示换行符。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>如果想要指示某些不需要使用转义符进行特别处理的字符串，那么需要指定一个原始字符串。原始字符串通过给字符串加上前缀 <code>r</code> 或 <code>R</code> 的方式指定，比如需要原样输出<code>\\n</code> 而不是令其换行，则代码如下:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a1e1acae-01f2-3f89-850a-ebbd5e625887","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"print(r\"you are china! \\n \\ \\r\")\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"60022379-7ca2-3379-a5af-f4f3186b670a","title":"","title_html":"","text":"输出为:\n\n```text\nyou are china! \\n \\ \\r\n```\n\n### 字符串截取\n字符串的截取格式为`字符串变量[start_index, end_index]`<br>\n\n此处注意字符串的截取从 `start_index` 开始，到 `end_index` 结束(但不含`end_index`下标出的字符)，也就是大家常理解的左闭右开，另外下标从0开始计算，甚至可以是负数, 如下所示:","text_html":"<p>输出为:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">you are china! \\n \\ \\r\n</code></pre>\n<h3>字符串截取</h3>\n<p>字符串的截取格式为<code>字符串变量[start_index, end_index]</code><br></p>\n<p>此处注意字符串的截取从 <code>start_index</code> 开始，到 <code>end_index</code> 结束(但不含<code>end_index</code>下标出的字符)，也就是大家常理解的左闭右开，另外下标从0开始计算，甚至可以是负数, 如下所示:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":7},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c6d64a5e-1651-30cc-a175-2ab83fe38a87","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"str='0123456789'\nprint(str[0]) #输出0\nprint(str[1:4]) #输出 123\nprint(str[-1]) #输出9\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":8},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1da6cd5f-0258-38bd-b91a-461db9e5f536","title":"","title_html":"","text":"### 字符串运算\n\n尝试下面代码:","text_html":"<h3>字符串运算</h3>\n<p>尝试下面代码:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":9},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"eb983460-000f-3de6-9c76-4fc79f14f9a3","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"a=1\nb='123'\nprint(a+b)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":10},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4771a359-528f-31c7-8c34-e648f8174e5e","title":"","title_html":"","text":"此时，运行程序会报错，错误提示如下所示，为什么呢？\n\n```text\n    print(a+b)\nTypeError: unsupported operand type(s) for +: 'int' and 'str'\n```\n\n字符串（`string`）只是 Python 中的一种数据类型，下面的语句在赋值的时候右侧用了单引号`'`，数据类型是字符串","text_html":"<p>此时，运行程序会报错，错误提示如下所示，为什么呢？</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">    print(a+b)\nTypeError: unsupported operand type(s) for +: &#x27;int&#x27; and &#x27;str&#x27;\n</code></pre>\n<p>字符串（<code>string</code>）只是 Python 中的一种数据类型，下面的语句在赋值的时候右侧用了单引号<code>&#x27;</code>，数据类型是字符串</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":11},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4333bd56-9063-3ced-9517-9e09ba48bc90","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"b='123'\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":12},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6aac3dce-aefe-37b3-8fd7-9ff8e6be998b","title":"","title_html":"","text":"下面语句的数据类型为整型（int）","text_html":"<p>下面语句的数据类型为整型（int）</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":13},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d3ec6064-5525-39ca-8f3a-62bc24859d5e","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"a=1\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":14},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c94867f1-bd3b-394d-8426-39fe6d8eaab4","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**不同的数据类型之间是不能进行运算的**，但是，不同数据类型可以相互转换，以上代码进行修改后就可以正常运行，修改后的代码如下:","text_html":"<p><strong>不同的数据类型之间是不能进行运算的</strong>，但是，不同数据类型可以相互转换，以上代码进行修改后就可以正常运行，修改后的代码如下:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":15},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"aeb45eeb-195a-32ed-bea0-55781d4c5eef","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"a=1\nb='123'\nprint(a + int(b))\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":16},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c341109f-e4d7-3f28-95ef-295e619f1a6d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"运行看看输出什么？\n> 注意：`+`号用在字符串中间是连接符，用在数值中间是运算符；`int()`将括号中的数值或文本转换成整型数据类型。\n\n因为相加的双方是**数值型数据**，所以此时`+`号是运算符，运行结果如下:\n\n```text\n124\n```\n\n当相加的双方是字符型数据时，`+`号是连接符。","text_html":"<p>运行看看输出什么？</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注意：<code>+</code>号用在字符串中间是连接符，用在数值中间是运算符；<code>int()</code>将括号中的数值或文本转换成整型数据类型。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>因为相加的双方是<strong>数值型数据</strong>，所以此时<code>+</code>号是运算符，运行结果如下:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">124\n</code></pre>\n<p>当相加的双方是字符型数据时，<code>+</code>号是连接符。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":17},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"54dccfda-9f17-3c7f-8460-f2e858e3485d","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"a=1\nb='123'\nprint(str(a) + b)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":18},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5ab1b8d9-30cf-37a9-b2d2-f44bab728d0b","title":"","title_html":"","text":"我们用`str()`将数字变量`a`转换成了字符串类型，输出结果为:\n\n```text\n1123\n```","text_html":"<p>我们用<code>str()</code>将数字变量<code>a</code>转换成了字符串类型，输出结果为:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":19}],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"假设`str=\"abcdefg\"` ，下面那个选项可以截取出字符串`bcd`:","question_text_html":"<p>假设<code>str=&quot;abcdefg&quot;</code> ，下面那个选项可以截取出字符串<code>bcd</code>:</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":10287,"key":"A","text":"str[1:4]","text_html":"<p>str[1:4]</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10288,"key":"B","text":"str[1:]","text_html":"<p>str[1:]</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10289,"key":"C","text":"str[2:3]","text_html":"<p>str[2:3]</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10290,"key":"D","text":"str[1:3]","text_html":"<p>str[1:3]</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"024","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/024/page/1318"}
